<article class="env-proposition" id="0F9C">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0F9C">Proposition <span data-tag="0F9C">6.3.2.3</span>.</a>colimit!of $\infty $-topoi The $\infty $-category $\LGeom $ admits small limits, and the inclusion functor $\LGeom \subseteq \widehat{\Cat }_{\infty }$ preserves small limits. </p>
</article>
<article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      According to Proposition <a href="/tag/F771" data-tag="F771">4.4.2.6</a>, it suffices to prove this result for pullbacks and small products. In the case of products, we apply Proposition <a href="/tag/C7CF" data-tag="C7CF">6.3.2.1</a>. For pullbacks, we use Proposition <a href="/tag/213A" data-tag="213A">6.3.2.2</a> and Theorem <a href="/tag/B6EE" data-tag="B6EE">4.2.4.1</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>